    {
      "source": "This method is forward-compatible with Java 21 SequencedCollections.",
      "translation": "该方法与 Java 21 中的 SequencedCollections 向前兼容。",
      "count": 7
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>destination</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>destination</code> 不能为 null。",
      "count": 6
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>destinationPosition</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>destinationPosition</code> 不得为 null。",
      "count": 6
    },
    {
      "source": "Atomically returns and removes the first element of the list stored at the bound key, and pushes the element at the\nfirst/last element (head/tail depending on the <a href=\"../../connection/RedisListCommands.Direction.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>destinationPosition</code></a> argument) of the list stored\nat <a href=\"RedisList.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.support.collections\"><code>destination</code></a>.",
      "translation": "原子性地返回并移除绑定键处存储的列表中的第一个元素，并将该元素推送到存储在<a href=\"RedisList.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.support.collections\"><code>destination</code></a>处的列表的开头/末尾（取决于<a href=\"../../connection/RedisListCommands.Direction.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>destinationPosition</code></a>参数）。",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "Atomically returns and removes the last element of the list stored at the bound key, and pushes the element at the\nfirst/last element (head/tail depending on the <a href=\"../../connection/RedisListCommands.Direction.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>destinationPosition</code></a> argument) of the list stored\nat <a href=\"RedisList.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.support.collections\"><code>destination</code></a>.",
      "translation": "原子性地返回并移除绑定键处存储的列表中的最后一个元素，并将该元素推送到存储在<a href=\"RedisList.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.support.collections\"><code>destination</code></a>处的列表的第一个/最后一个位置（取决于<a href=\"../../connection/RedisListCommands.Direction.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>destinationPosition</code></a>参数）。",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "<b>Blocks connection</b> until element available or <code>timeout</code> reached.",
      "translation": "<b>阻塞连接</b>，直到元素可用或达到<code>timeout</code>。",
      "count": 4
