    {
      "source": "The encounter order of elements returned by the view is the inverse of the encounter order of the elements stored\nin this collection. The reverse ordering affects all order-sensitive operations, including any operations on\nfurther views of the returned view. If the collection implementation permits modifications to this view, the\nmodifications \"write-through\" to the underlying collection. Changes to the underlying collection might or might not\nbe visible in this reversed view, depending upon the implementation.",
      "translation": "视图返回元素的相遇顺序与此集合中存储元素的相遇顺序相反。这种反向排序会影响所有对顺序敏感的操作，包括对返回视图的进一步视图上的任何操作。如果集合实现允许对此视图进行修改，则这些修改会“写透”到底层集合。底层集合的更改是否在此反向视图中可见，取决于具体实现。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Redis extension for the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> contract. Supports <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Queue.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Queue</code></a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Deque.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Deque</code></a> contracts as\nwell as their equivalent blocking siblings <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/BlockingDeque.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>BlockingDeque</code></a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/BlockingDeque.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>BlockingDeque</code></a>.",
      "translation": "Redis 扩展支持 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a> 契约，同时支持 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/List.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>List</code></a>、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Queue.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Queue</code></a> 和 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Deque.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Deque</code></a> 契约，以及它们对应的阻塞版本 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/BlockingDeque.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>BlockingDeque</code></a> 和 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/BlockingDeque.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>BlockingDeque</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
